      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1908-07-25_WidnesExaminer_art0048" n="art0048">
        <head>£2.100 DAMAGES FOR LOVERS.</head>
        <p>£2.100 DAMAGES FOR LOVERS.</p>
        <p>At the Glamorgan Assizes on Thursday, W. Thomas' civil engineer, Swansea, was awarded £1,500 and costs, and Miss Evans, of Montpelier-terrace, Swansea, his fiance% £6OO damages against the London rnd ,North- Western Railwey Company for injuries :eceiced in the Shrewsbury railway disaster.</p>
      </div>
